nities. Among Saima Builders\' new projects in Karachi, it stands out for its established urban setting.</p><h3>ZSZ Midtown Farms</h3><p>ZSZ Midtown Farms is one of the group\'s most ambitious upcoming projects, spanning 390 acres of residential development. It is positioned as a large-scale community and reflects the developer\'s ability to execute master-planned environments. For buyers comparing Saima Premium Empire with larger ventures, ZSZ Midtown Farms offers a different scale and lifestyle proposition. It represents the plotted development format within Saima Builders\' new projects.</p><h3>Saima Center Point</h3><p>Saima Center Point is a landmark mixed-use development on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi Cantt, near Capri Cinema in Saddar. The project is a Ground + 41-floor complex with a shopping mall, parking, and residential apartments. It offers 2- to 4-bedroom residences alongside commercial showrooms. For buyers seeking apartments for sale in Karachi within a mixed-use setting, Center Point demonstrates the developer\'s capability in large-scale urban projects, standing out among Saima\'s new projects in Karachi.</p><h3>Saima Dreams</h3><p>Saima Dreams is a luxury residential project in Scheme 33, featuring G+16 high-rise buildings with 4-, 5-, and 6-room apartments. It is designed for premium living near Main Safoora Chowrangi. Among Saima\'s new projects in Karachi, it competes directly with Saima Premium Empire in the premium apartment segment.</p><h3>Saima One Residency Clifton</h3><p>Saima One Residency in Clifton Block 5 is among the developer\'s most premium upcoming launches, offering sea-facing luxury apartments. It fills a genuine supply gap in one of Karachi\'s most exclusive corridors. As a Saima Builders new project, it represents the premium end of the portfolio.</p><h3>Saima Mangroves</h3><p>Saima Mangroves is a mixed-use waterfront development at Korangi Creek, being developed under a Development Advisory Agreement with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group of Saima Builders. Spanning approximately 40 acres of waterfront land, the master plan envisages over 12 million square feet of built-up area, incorporating residential apartments, commercial offices, and a deluxe hotel. The project\'s launch drew an oversubscribed response, signaling institutional confidence.</p><h3>Saima Shield Towers</h3><p>Saima Shield Towers is a collaborative high-rise residential project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, listed as under construction since June 2021. It spans 1,315,000 square feet and features 4- and 5-bedroom luxury apartments. Residents benefit from a secure gated environment with amenities including a gym, community hall, and standby generators.</p><h3>Saima Arabian Villas</h3><p>Saima Arabian Villas is a delivered gated villa community in North Karachi, representing the developer\'s low-rise and community format. It demonstrates Saima\'s ability to deliver completed, habitable communities, a track record that supports confidence in under-construction Saima Builders\' new projects.</p><h3>Saima Defence Mall and Residency</h3><p>Saima Defence Mall and Residency is a completed mixed-use development located in DHA Phase 1, Karachi. The project features 3-bedroom apartments alongside commercial showrooms, supported by amenities including a modern gymnasium, an in-house mosque, a coffee shop, and electricity backup. As completed stock, it serves as tangible evidence of construction quality and handover discipline.</p><h3>Saima Jinnah Icon</h3><p>Saima Jinnah Icon is a mixed-use and residential project in Karachi. It shows the group\'s ability to combine commercial and residential components. Investors reviewing Saima Builders\' ongoing projects in Karachi should note that mixed-use projects carry different leasing and maintenance dynamics compared to pure residential towers.</p><h2>Property Types in the Saima Portfolio</h2><p>Saima Builders offers a range of property formats across its portfolio. The table below maps these offerings to specific Saima projects in Karachi and delivered developments.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Property Types</td><td>Projects</td></tr><tr><td>High-rise residential apartments</td><td>Saima Premium Empire, Saima Dreams, Saima Shield Towers, Saima Center Point</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-rise residential buildings</td><td>Saima Jinnah Icon</td></tr><tr><td>Gated villa and townhouse communities</td><td>Saima Arabian Villas</td></tr><tr><td>Mixed-use commercial and residential developments</td><td>Saima Jinnah Icon, Saima Defence Mall and Residency, Saima Mangroves, Saima Center Point</td></tr><tr><td>Plotted developments</td><td>ZSZ Midtown Farms</td></tr><tr><td>Waterfront and seafront towers</td><td>Saima One Residency Clifton, Saima Mangroves</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>This diversification signals institutional experience. For buyers exploring Saima Builders\' new projects in Karachi, the portfolio spans entry-level apartments to premium seafront towers. Saima Builders\' new projects continue to be launched across these formats, reinforcing the group\'s position among residential and commercial developers in Karachi.</p><h2>Investment Potential</h2><p>Saima Builders offers real estate investment opportunities through its diverse portfolio, established locations, and four decades of delivery history. With growing interest in Karachi\'s premium property segment, the group presents opportunities for investors seeking long-term capital appreciation and rental income.</p><h3>Key Investment Highlights</h3><ul><li>Diverse portfolio spanning high-rise apartments, gated villas, plots, and mixed-use developments</li><li>Developed by Saima Builders and Developers, active since the mid-1980s</li><li>Appeal among end-users and overseas property investors</li><li>Locations across established Karachi districts, including North Nazimabad, DHA, and Clifton</li><li>Potential for long-term capital appreciation in Karachi\'s premium sector</li><li>Lifestyle destinations for families and professionals</li><li>Flexible payment plans across most projects, reducing entry barriers for buyers interested in apartments from Saima Builders Karachi</li><li>Institutional partnerships, including TPL REIT Fund I for Saima Mangroves</li></ul><h2>Location and Coverage: Saima Builders Karachi, Hyderabad, Sukkur</h2><p>Saima Builders operates across Karachi, Hyderabad, and Sukkur, making it one of the established builders in Karachi, Pakistan.</p><p>In Karachi, the group builds in North Nazimabad, Gulshan-e-Maymar, Scheme 33, DHA, and Clifton.</p><p>Outside Karachi, projects include Saima Uptown Sukkur in Sukkur and developments in Hyderabad.</p><p>The group ranks among real estate builders in Karachi, residential developers in Karachi, commercial developers in Karachi, and high-rise builders in Karachi, with towers like Saima Premium Empire and mixed-use projects like Saima Center Point. This multi-city footprint supports its position among builders in Karachi, Pakistan.<br></p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:1;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:62:\"Saima Group Builders | Latest Real Estate Projects in Pakistan\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:159:\"Saima Builders & Developers (Saima Group) is one of the Best real estate developers of the Pakistan with 117+ projects across Karachi, Islamabad & many more on\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";N;s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-10-20 11:37:08\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-10-28 12:14:21\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:3:{s:9:\"in_navbar\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"is_published\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"navbar_order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:1:{s:8:\"sections\";O:39:\"Illuminate\\Database\\