('laravel-cache-page_data_about-us', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":33:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:14:{s:2:\"id\";i:2;s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"About Us\";s:4:\"slug\";s:8:\"about-us\";s:4:\"body\";s:1342:\"<h2>About Hudayriyat Island Real Estate</h2>\r\n<p>Welcome to your trusted source for exploring premier property opportunities on Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi. We connect discerning homeowners, expatriate residents, and global investors with prestigious master-planned developments built by Modon Properties.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Core Services</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Property Advisory:</strong> Practical guidance to help you explore residential and investment opportunities based on your personal budget and lifestyle requirements.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Exclusive Listings:</strong> Full access to premier residential properties, villas, townhouses, and waterfront apartments across Hudayriyat Island.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Market Intelligence:</strong> Transparent, updated information regarding launch dates, construction milestones, payment schedules, and capital appreciation potential.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Mission, Vision & Values</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Our Mission:</strong> To provide accurate property intelligence, honest advisory, and reliable assistance to buyers and investors exploring Abu Dhabi\'s emerging master destinations.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Vision:</strong> To become the leading advisory reference for luxury island real estate in the UAE.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Values:</strong> Accuracy, transparency, and client-first commitment define everything we do.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:2;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:42:\"About Us – Hudayriyat Island Real Estate\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:138:\"Learn more about Hudayriyat Island property opportunities, expert advisory services, and master planning by Modon Properties in Abu Dhabi.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:63:\"About Hudayriyat, Modon Properties, Abu Dhabi property advisory\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-10-20 11:37:08\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-10-28 11:07:14\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:14:{s:2:\"id\";i:2;s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"About Us\";s:4:\"slug\";s:8:\"about-us\";s:4:\"body\";s:1342:\"<h2>About Hudayriyat Island Real Estate</h2>\r\n<p>Welcome to your trusted source for exploring premier property opportunities on Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi. We connect discerning homeowners, expatriate residents, and global investors with prestigious master-planned developments built by Modon Properties.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Core Services</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Property Advisory:</strong> Practical guidance to help you explore residential and investment opportunities based on your personal budget and lifestyle requirements.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Exclusive Listings:</strong> Full access to premier residential properties, villas, townhouses, and waterfront apartments across Hudayriyat Island.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Market Intelligence:</strong> Transparent, updated information regarding launch dates, construction milestones, payment schedules, and capital appreciation potential.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Mission, Vision & Values</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Our Mission:</strong> To provide accurate property intelligence, honest advisory, and reliable assistance to buyers and investors exploring Abu Dhabi\'s emerging master destinations.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Vision:</strong> To become the leading advisory reference for luxury island real estate in the UAE.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Values:</strong> Accuracy, transparency, and client-first commitment define everything we do.</p>\