(1, 1, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Builders and Developers\",\"subtitle\":\"Smart Investments, Strong Returns, Better Futures Through Trusted Property Development.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793173886_6ae1a97e23a48.webp\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Builders and Developers\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Builders and Developers\"}', '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 08:22:28'),
(2, 1, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"launch_price\":\"AED 4,300,000*\",\"handover\":\"Q3 2030\",\"property_type\":\"Villas & Apartments\",\"ownership\":\"Freehold\",\"items\":[],\"price\":\"AED 4,300,000*\",\"highlight_new_1793169253236\":\"\"}', '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 08:22:28'),
(3, 1, 'content', 'Content', 5, 1, '{\"html\":\"<p>Saima Builders is one of the names that buyers tracking real estate developers in Karachi encounter early in their search. Saima Builders and Developers, often referred to simply as Saima Group, has operated in Pakistan\'s property market for around four decades. Saima Builders Karachi remains the group\'s core focus, with a portfolio spanning apartments, villas, plots, and mixed-use developments. Saima Group Karachi is therefore best understood as a legacy developer rather than a new entrant, and that distinction matters when comparing options among best builders in Karachi.<\\/p><h2>About Saima Builders and Developers<\\/h2><p>Saima Builders was founded by Saleem Zaki, who established the company in the mid-1980s with a vision to provide quality housing and modern urban communities. The group is now led by Chairman Zeeshan Saleem Zaki, who joined the family business in 1988 and has overseen the delivery of more than 80 residential, commercial, and mixed-use projects. According to the company\'s own disclosures, it has more than 30 additional developments under way across Pakistan.<\\/p><p>For buyers evaluating Saima Group, the relevant point is delivery history. Saima Builders and Developers is not a first-time developer launch. The group\'s record includes completed projects and a continuing pipeline. Saima Builders Karachi therefore benefits from an established sales, construction, and handover system. Saima Group Karachi buyers should still verify documents, but they are not underwriting an unknown builder. Among property developers in Karachi, that track record carries weight.<\\/p><h2>Cities Where Saima Builders Operates<\\/h2><p>Saima Builders Karachi remains the primary market, with projects in North Nazimabad, Gulshan-e-Maymar, Scheme 33, DHA, and near Jinnah International Airport.<\\/p><p>Outside Karachi, Saima Builders has a presence in Hyderabad and Sukkur, reflecting its reach as one of the real estate developers in Pakistan with a multi-city footprint.<\\/p><p>For buyers searching for a Saima project Karachi, the concentration in Karachi is an advantage. The developer knows the city\'s approval routes and demand patterns. Saima Builders Karachi is not a peripheral operator; it builds in established districts. When reviewing Saima projects in Karachi, location depth matters as much as project specifications.<\\/p><h2>Saima Projects in Karachi<\\/h2><p>The following projects represent the current pipeline of Saima Builders\' new projects and ongoing projects in Karachi.<\\/p><h3>Saima Premium Empire<\\/h3><p>Saima Premium Empire is a residential high-rise in Block A, North Nazimabad Town, Karachi Central District. It is listed by the developer as under construction. The project targets buyers who want central Karachi rather than a distant society. Saima Premium Empire therefore has a rental and end-user case that depends on location more than new amenities. Among Saima Builders\' new projects in Karachi, it stands out for its established urban setting.<\\/p><h3>ZSZ Midtown Farms<\\/h3><p>ZSZ Midtown Farms is one of the group\'s most ambitious upcoming projects, spanning 390 acres of residential development. It is positioned as a large-scale community and reflects the developer\'s ability to execute master-planned environments. For buyers comparing Saima Premium Empire with larger ventures, ZSZ Midtown Farms offers a different scale and lifestyle proposition. It represents the plotted development format within Saima Builders\' new projects.<\\/p><h3>Saima Center Point<\\/h3><p>Saima Center Point is a landmark mixed-use development on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi Cantt, near Capri Cinema in Saddar. The project is a Ground + 41-floor complex with a shopping mall, parking, and residential apartments. It offers 2- to 4-bedroom residences alongside commercial showrooms. For buyers seeking apartments for sale in Karachi within a mixed-use setting, Center Point demonstrates the developer\'s capability in large-scale urban projects, standing out among Saima\'s new projects in Karachi.<\\/p><h3>Saima Dreams<\\/h3><p>Saima Dreams is a luxury residential project in Scheme 33, featuring G+16 high-rise buildings with 4-, 5-, and 6-room apartments. It is designed for premium living near Main Safoora Chowrangi. Among Saima\'s new projects in Karachi, it competes directly with Saima Premium Empire in the premium apartment segment.<\\/p><h3>Saima One Residency Clifton<\\/h3><p>Saima One Residency in Clifton Block 5 is among the developer\'s most premium upcoming launches, offering sea-facing luxury apartments. It fills a genuine supply gap in one of Karachi\'s most exclusive corridors. As a Saima Builders new project, it represents the premium end of the portfolio.<\\/p><h3>Saima Mangroves<\\/h3><p>Saima Mangroves is a mixed-use waterfront development at Korangi Creek, being developed under a Development Advisory Agreement with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group of Saima Builders. Spanning approximately 40 acres of waterfront land, the master plan envisages over 12 million square feet of built-up area, incorporating residential apartments, commercial offices, and a deluxe hotel. The project\'s launch drew an oversubscribed response, signaling institutional confidence.<\\/p><h3>Saima Shield Towers<\\/h3><p>Saima Shield Towers is a collaborative high-rise residential project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, listed as under construction since June 2021. It spans 1,315,000 square feet and features 4- and 5-bedroom luxury apartments. Residents benefit from a secure gated environment with amenities including a gym, community hall, and standby generators.<\\/p><h3>Saima Arabian Villas<\\/h3><p>Saima Arabian Villas is a delivered gated villa community in North Karachi, representing the developer\'s low-rise and community format. It demonstrates Saima\'s ability to deliver completed, habitable communities, a track record that supports confidence in under-construction Saima Builders\' new projects.<\\/p><h3>Saima Defence Mall and Residency<\\/h3><p>Saima Defence Mall and Residency is a completed mixed-use development located in DHA Phase 1, Karachi. The project features 3-bedroom apartments alongside commercial showrooms, supported by amenities including a modern gymnasium, an in-house mosque, a coffee shop, and electricity backup. As completed stock, it serves as tangible evidence of construction quality and handover discipline.<\\/p><h3>Saima Jinnah Icon<\\/h3><p>Saima Jinnah Icon is a mixed-use and residential project in Karachi. It shows the group\'s ability to combine commercial and residential components. Investors reviewing Saima Builders\' ongoing projects in Karachi should note that mixed-use projects carry different leasing and maintenance dynamics compared to pure residential towers.<\\/p><h2>Property Types in the Saima Portfolio<\\/h2><p>Saima Builders offers a range of property formats across its portfolio. The table below maps these offerings to specific Saima projects in Karachi and delivered developments.<\\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>Property Types<\\/td><td>Projects<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>High-rise residential apartments<\\/td><td>Saima Premium Empire, Saima Dreams, Saima Shield Towers, Saima Center Point<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Mid-rise residential buildings<\\/td><td>Saima Jinnah Icon<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Gated villa and townhouse communities<\\/td><td>Saima Arabian Villas<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Mixed-use commercial and residential developments<\\/td><td>Saima Jinnah Icon, Saima Defence Mall and Residency, Saima Mangroves, Saima Center Point<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Plotted developments<\\/td><td>ZSZ Midtown Farms<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Waterfront and seafront towers<\\/td><td>Saima One Residency Clifton, Saima Mangroves<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><p><br>This diversification signals institutional experience. For buyers exploring Saima Builders\' new projects in Karachi, the portfolio spans entry-level apartments to premium seafront towers. Saima Builders\' new projects continue to be launched across these formats, reinforcing the group\'s position among residential and commercial developers in Karachi.<\\/p><h2>Investment Potential<\\/h2><p>Saima Builders offers real estate investment opportunities through its diverse portfolio, established locations, and four decades of delivery history. With growing interest in Karachi\'s premium property segment, the group presents opportunities for investors seeking long-term capital appreciation and rental income.<\\/p><h3>Key Investment Highlights<\\/h3><ul><li>Diverse portfolio spanning high-rise apartments, gated villas, plots, and mixed-use developments<\\/li><li>Developed by Saima Builders and Developers, active since the mid-1980s<\\/li><li>Appeal among end-users and overseas property investors<\\/li><li>Locations across established Karachi districts, including North Nazimabad, DHA, and Clifton<\\/li><li>Potential for long-term capital appreciation in Karachi\'s premium sector<\\/li><li>Lifestyle destinations for families and professionals<\\/li><li>Flexible payment plans across most projects, reducing entry barriers for buyers interested in apartments from Saima Builders Karachi<\\/li><li>Institutional partnerships, including TPL REIT Fund I for Saima Mangroves<\\/li><\\/ul><h2>Location and Coverage: Saima Builders Karachi, Hyderabad, Sukkur<\\/h2><p>Saima Builders operates across Karachi, Hyderabad, and Sukkur, making it one of the established builders in Karachi, Pakistan.<\\/p><p>In Karachi, the group builds in North Nazimabad, Gulshan-e-Maymar, Scheme 33, DHA, and Clifton.<\\/p><p>Outside Karachi, projects include Saima Uptown Sukkur in Sukkur and developments in Hyderabad.<\\/p><p>The group ranks among real estate builders in Karachi, residential developers in Karachi, commercial developers in Karachi, and high-rise builders in Karachi, with towers like Saima Premium Empire and mixed-use projects like Saima Center Point. This multi-city footprint supports its position among builders in Karachi, Pakistan.<br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 08:22:28'),
(4, 1, 'investment', 'Investment & Financing', 4, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Investment Potential\",\"location_badge\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Builders and Developers offers real estate investment opportunities in Karachi through its residential and commercial projects. With a range of properties designed for different buyer needs, Saima projects may appeal to investors looking for long-term property value and potential rental income. Buyers should review each project\'s location, construction progress, payment plan, and legal status before investing.<\\/p>\",\"highlights_heading\":\"Key Investment Highlights:\",\"investment_highlights\":[{\"text\":\"Residential and commercial property options in Karachi\"},{\"text\":\"Multiple projects in different areas of the city\"},{\"text\":\"Property options for homebuyers and investors\"},{\"text\":\"Potential rental income from suitable properties\"},{\"text\":\"Opportunity for long-term property value growth\"},{\"text\":\"Options for different budgets and investment goals\"},{\"text\":\"Convenient access to local facilities, depending on the project location\"}],\"cta\":\"Contact a Property Investment Consultant\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793193748_6ae1f714366a5.webp\",\"image_alt\":\"Hudayriyat Island Investment Potential\",\"financing_highlights\":[]}', '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 08:22:28'),
