-villas\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/al-naseem.jpg\"},{\"name\":\"Masyaf Plots\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: Launch Soon\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Launch Soon\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Payment Plan: Launch Soon\",\"href\":\"\\/masyaf-plots\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/masyaf-plots.jpg\"},{\"name\":\"Nawayef Village\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 4.1M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q1 2029\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"10\\/40\\/50 Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/nawayef-village\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/nawayef-village.jpg\"},{\"name\":\"Wadeem Plots\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 3.7M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q4 2028\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"10\\/40\\/50 Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/wadeem-plots\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/wadeem-plots.jpg\"},{\"name\":\"Nawayef Park Views\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 2.1M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q1 2028\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"10\\/40\\/50 Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/nawayef-park-views\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/nawayef-park-views.jpg\"}],\"selected_ids\":[1,2,3,5,6,4,7,8,9,10],\"unselected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[1,2,3,5,6,4,7,8,9,10]}', '2026-10-21 04:41:00', '2026-10-28 08:22:28'),
(14, 1, 'overview_location', 'Overview & Location', 6, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Saima Builders and Developers Overview and Location\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793193706_6ae1f6ea118b9.webp\",\"image_alt\":\"Hudayriyat Island Overview and Luxury Villas\",\"paragraphs\":\"<p>Saima Builders and Developers offers residential and commercial property options across Karachi, Pakistan. Its projects provide opportunities for homebuyers and investors looking for properties in different parts of the city. Each project has its own location, facilities, and property options to suit different needs.<\\/p><p>Saima projects are located in various areas of Karachi, giving buyers options based on their preferred neighbourhood, budget, and daily travel needs. Depending on the project location, residents may have access to schools, hospitals, shopping centres, restaurants, public transport, and other essential facilities.<\\/p><p>Karachi offers access to major business districts, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and shopping destinations. Buyers can compare individual Saima projects to find a property that suits their lifestyle or investment plans.<br><span style=\\\"font-family: inherit;\\\"><br>With a range of property options across Karachi, Saima Builders and Developers provides opportunities for people looking to buy a home or invest in real estate. Before making a decision, buyers should check the exact project location, nearby facilities, construction status, and available payment plans.<\\/span><\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-21 04:41:00', '2026-10-28 08:22:28'),
(16, 1, 'faq', 'FAQ Section', 7, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":null,\"items\":[{\"q\":\"What is Saima Builders and Developers?\",\"a\":\"Saima Builders and Developers is a real estate developer associated with residential and commercial projects in Karachi, Pakistan.\"},{\"q\":\"Where are Saima Builders and Developers projects located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Builders and Developers has projects in different areas of Karachi. Check each project\'s location to explore nearby facilities and road access.\"},{\"q\":\"What types of properties does Saima Builders offer?\",\"a\":\"Saima Builders offers residential and commercial property options. Available property types depend on the specific project and current inventory.\"},{\"q\":\"Are Saima Builders apartments available for sale in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Buyers can explore Saima apartment projects in Karachi and confirm available units, prices, sizes, and booking details with the relevant project office.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the prices of Saima Builders properties?\",\"a\":\"Saima Builders property prices vary by project, location, unit size, and property type. Contact the relevant project office for current prices.\"},{\"q\":\"Does Saima Builders offer flexible payment plans?\",\"a\":\"Payment plans vary by project and may include booking payments and instalments. Confirm the current payment schedule with the project representatives.\"},{\"q\":\"Does Saima Builders have new projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Buyers can check Saima Builders\' latest project announcements to explore new developments, available properties, and current booking opportunities.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Builders a good option for property investment?\",\"a\":\"Saima properties may suit investors depending on location, price, rental demand, and market conditions. Review each project before investing.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I book a property with Saima Builders?\",\"a\":\"Contact the relevant Saima project office to check availability, review payment terms, verify documents, and understand the booking process.\"},{\"q\":\"What should I check before buying a Saima Builders property?\",\"a\":\"Check the property\'s legal status, location, total price, payment plan, construction progress, and expected completion date before making a purchase.\"}],\"description\":null}', '2026-10-21 04:41:00', '2026-10-29 01:11:50'),
(17, 2, 'pillars', 'Mission, Vision & Values', 4, 1, '{\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Our Mission\",\"icon\":\"target\",\"description\":\"To provide clear property information, reliable guidance, and helpful support to buyers and investors exploring property opportunities across Karachi.\"},{\"title\":\"Our Vision\",\"icon\":\"eye\",\"description\":\"To become a trusted name in the real estate sector by providing useful property information, transparent communication, and consistent support throughout the property search process.\"},{\"title\":\"Our Values\",\"icon\":\"shield\",\"description\":\"Accuracy, transparency, and customer satisfaction guide our approach. We focus on sharing clear project details and helping buyers understand their options before making important property decisions.\"}]}', '2026-10-21 08:32:16', '2026-10-29 00:51:53'),
