(71, 6, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"What is Bashayer Residences?\",\"a\":\"Bashayer Residences is a residential community by Modon Properties on Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi, offering apartments and townhouses.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is the developer of Bashayer Residences?\",\"a\":\"Bashayer Residences is developed by Modon Properties.\"},{\"q\":\"What types of properties are available at Bashayer Residences?\",\"a\":\"Bashayer Residences offers 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, along with 3-bedroom duplexes and townhouses.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the starting price of Bashayer Residences?\",\"a\":\"The starting price for Bashayer Residences is approximately AED 1.25 million, depending on unit type and layout.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the payment plan for Bashayer Residences?\",\"a\":\"Bashayer Residences offers a flexible 40\\/60 payment plan, with 10% on booking, 30% during construction, and 60% on handover.\"},{\"q\":\"When is the handover of Bashayer Residences?\",\"a\":\"Handover is scheduled for Q4 2028.\"},{\"q\":\"Where is Bashayer Residences located?\",\"a\":\"Bashayer Residences is located on Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi, within easy reach of beaches, sports facilities, and entertainment attractions.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Bashayer Residences freehold?\",\"a\":\"Yes, Bashayer Residences is a freehold development open to buyers of all nationalities.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities are available at Bashayer Residences?\",\"a\":\"Amenities include a swimming pool, gymnasium, children\'s play areas, landscaped gardens, and access to Hudayriyat Island\'s sports and leisure attractions.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"\"}', '2026-10-21 09:31:36', '2026-10-29 04:19:47'),
