(77, 7, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Is Bashayer Villas a freehold development in Abu Dhabi?\",\"a\":\"Yes, Bashayer Villas on Hudayriyat Island is a 100% freehold development open to buyers and investors of all nationalities.\"},{\"q\":\"What types of villas are available at Bashayer Villas?\",\"a\":\"Bashayer Villas offers luxury 3, 4, and 5-bedroom villas with contemporary architectural designs, private gardens, and spacious layouts.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the starting price of Bashayer Villas in Abu Dhabi?\",\"a\":\"Starting prices for Bashayer Villas begin from approximately AED 4.5 million, subject to unit selection, size, and location.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the handover date for Bashayer Villas?\",\"a\":\"The handover for Bashayer Villas is scheduled for Q4 2028.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities are available at Bashayer Villas?\",\"a\":\"Residents enjoy access to a community clubhouse, infinity pool, fitness center, landscaped parklands, jogging trails, and retail centers.\"},{\"q\":\"How is the location and connectivity of Bashayer Villas?\",\"a\":\"Positioned on Hudayriyat Island, Bashayer Villas offers rapid access to Downtown Abu Dhabi (10 mins), Zayed International Airport (25 mins), and Yas Island (30 mins).\"},{\"q\":\"Is Bashayer Villas suitable for families in Abu Dhabi?\",\"a\":\"Yes, the community is designed specifically for family living with pedestrian-friendly green corridors, premier schools nearby, and top-tier sports facilities.\"},{\"q\":\"What payment plan is offered for Bashayer Villas?\",\"a\":\"A flexible construction-linked payment plan is available, featuring 10% on booking, installments during construction, and the balance upon completion.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"\"}', '2026-10-21 09:31:36', '2026-10-29 04:21:08'),
