(83, 8, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Can anyone buy a villa at Al Naseem community?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Al Naseem community offers freehold ownership, available to all nationalities, making it fully accessible to UAE residents and international foreign investors.\"},{\"q\":\"What bedroom options are available?\",\"a\":\"Al Naseem community features spacious 4, 5, and 6-bedroom luxury villas, each offered in two architectural elevations: South Californian and Modern.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the villa area range?\",\"a\":\"Villa sizes at Al Naseem community range from approximately 5,274 sq ft to 6,673 sq ft, with plot sizes spanning from 7,373 sq ft to 10,764 sq ft.\"},{\"q\":\"Where is Al Naseem community located?\",\"a\":\"Al Naseem community is centrally positioned within Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi, offering direct access to cycling tracks, sports hubs, beach clubs, and the upcoming Surf Abu Dhabi.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Naseem community a completed project?\",\"a\":\"No, Al Naseem community is an off-plan development with handover scheduled for Q1 2029, offering attractive construction-linked payment plans.\"},{\"q\":\"Can foreigners own property in Abu Dhabi?\",\"a\":\"Yes, Abu Dhabi permits 100% freehold property ownership for all nationalities in designated investment zones, which includes the entirety of Hudayriyat Island.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Everything you need to know about purchasing a luxury villa at Al Naseem, Hudayriyat Island\"}', '2026-10-21 09:31:36', '2026-10-29 04:20:56'),
