(95, 10, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Can foreigners and expatriates purchase residential plots in Masyaf?\",\"a\":\"Yes, Masyaf Plots on Hudayriyat Island is a designated freehold investment zone, allowing 100% freehold ownership for both UAE nationals and international buyers.\"},{\"q\":\"What type of properties can be built in Masyaf?\",\"a\":\"Purchasers can design and build custom luxury residential villas adhering to Modon\'s high architectural and master-planning guidelines.\"},{\"q\":\"Where is Masyaf located on Hudayriyat Island?\",\"a\":\"Masyaf is situated in a prime coastal position on Hudayriyat Island, offering direct connectivity to Abu Dhabi city center within 10-15 minutes.\"},{\"q\":\"Are Masyaf residential plots eligible for the UAE Golden Visa?\",\"a\":\"Yes, property and land purchases meeting the UAE real estate investment threshold of AED 2 million qualify the owner and their family for the 10-Year UAE Golden Visa.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Key inquiries and essential information regarding ownership at Masyaf Plots\"}', '2026-10-21 09:31:36', '2026-10-29 04:20:44'),
