(101, 11, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Nawayef Village located?\",\"a\":\"It\\u2019s situated on Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi, nestled between the Nawayef West and East Hills, with elevated terrain and panoramic views.\"},{\"q\":\"When is handover scheduled?\",\"a\":\"Residents can expect handover in Q1 2029.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the payment plan structure of Nawayef Village?\",\"a\":\"The flexible payment plan follows a 10\\/40\\/50 model, 10% on booking, 40% during construction, and the remaining 50% upon handover in January 2029.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is the developer behind this community?\",\"a\":\"Nawayef Village is developed by Modon Properties, an Abu Dhabi-based firm known for premium large\\u2011scale residential projects.\"},{\"q\":\"What types of homes are available in Nawayef Village?\",\"a\":\"Nawayef Village offers 3 to 5 bedroom townhouses and twin villas, with sizes ranging from approximately 2,669 sq ft to 3,670 sq ft.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities are provided at Nawayef Village?\",\"a\":\"Residents enjoy gated community security, parks, green spaces, walking and cycling paths, community centres, pools, boutique retail, fine dining, cinema, fitness facilities, schools, medical services, and direct beach access.\"},{\"q\":\"How close is Nawayef Village to key landmarks?\",\"a\":\"Nawayef Village is just 15 minutes to the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque and 25 minutes to Zayed International Airport. Saadiyat Island and ADGM are also within easy reach.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Key inquiries and essential information regarding ownership at Nawayef Village\"}', '2026-10-21 09:31:36', '2026-10-29 04:20:34'),
