(173, 15, 'content', 'Content', 3, 1, '{\"html\":\"<h2>1. Agreement to Terms<\\/h2>\\n<p>By accessing or using this website, you agree to these Terms &amp;amp; Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please stop using the website.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>2. Website Use<\\/h2>\\n<p>This website provides general property information and real estate-related services, including information about properties and projects on Hudayriyat Island and across Abu Dhabi. You must use this website lawfully and responsibly.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>3. Property Information<\\/h2>\\n<p>Property listings, prices, layouts, specifications, payment plans, availability, and handover dates are provided for general reference only. Property information may change without notice and does not constitute a binding offer or contract.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>4. No Professional Advice<\\/h2>\\n<p>The information provided on this website does not constitute legal, financial, tax, investment, or immigration advice. You should conduct your own research and consult qualified professionals.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>5. No Guarantee of Returns<\\/h2>\\n<p>No guarantee is provided regarding future property values, rental income, capital appreciation, or investment returns. Past performance of a property or developer does not guarantee future results.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>6. User Responsibilities<\\/h2>\\n<p>You are responsible for providing accurate and complete information when submitting enquiries through this website. Unauthorized use or misrepresentation is strictly prohibited.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>7. Intellectual Property<\\/h2>\\n<p>All text, logos, graphics, images, and content on this website are owned by their respective owners and protected by copyright and intellectual property laws.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>8. Third-Party Links<\\/h2>\\n<p>This website may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience only and we do not endorse or take responsibility for third-party content.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>9. Limitation of Liability<\\/h2>\\n<p>We take reasonable steps to provide accurate information, but make no warranties regarding completeness or timeliness. Users should independently verify details before making a decision.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>10. Governing Law<\\/h2>\\n<p>These Terms &amp;amp; Conditions shall be governed by the applicable laws and regulations of the United Arab Emirates and the Emirate of Abu Dhabi.<\\/p>\\n\"}', '2026-10-22 07:14:41', '2026-10-28 05:50:36'),
(174, 16, 'content', 'Content', 3, 1, '{\"html\":\"<h2>1. General Information Only<\\/h2><p>The content on this website, including information about properties, property descriptions, prices, payment plans, rental yield estimates, project details, and real estate market updates, is provided for general informational purposes only. It does not constitute an offer, solicitation, or recommendation to buy, sell, or invest in any property.<\\/p><h2>2. No Guarantee of Returns, Rental Yield or Appreciation<\\/h2><p>Any rental yield percentage, return on investment (ROI), or capital appreciation figure mentioned on this website is an indicative estimate based on general market information available at the time of publication. It is not a forecast, promise, or guarantee of future performance. Actual returns may vary depending on market conditions, rental demand, tenancy, maintenance charges, property management, location, and the specific property purchased. Past performance of any property, housing society, or developer is not a reliable indicator of future results.<\\/p><h2>3. Not Financial, Legal or Tax Advice<\\/h2><p>Nothing on this website constitutes financial, legal, or tax advice. Property purchases and investments may involve financial risks, legal requirements, taxes, and other costs. You should obtain independent professional advice based on your individual circumstances before making any property or investment decision in Pakistan.<\\/p><h2>4. Developer & Property Information<\\/h2><p>Prices, availability, floor plans, payment plans, property specifications, possession dates, and project details are subject to change without notice. Information may be provided by property developers, builders, housing societies, real estate agents, and other available sources. We recommend verifying the latest property details, prices, payment terms, approvals, and availability directly with the relevant developer or authorized authority before making any commitment.<\\/p><p>Buyers should independently verify the legal status of a property or housing project, including relevant approvals, ownership documents, land title, and applicable requirements from authorities such as the relevant Development Authority, local government, or other competent regulatory body.<\\/p><h2>5. Regulatory Status<\\/h2><p>Information provided on this website is intended for general property and real estate purposes in Pakistan. This website is not a government website and is not affiliated with or operated by any Pakistani government authority. Nothing on this website should be interpreted as official government communication, legal advice, or regulatory approval of any property, project, developer, or housing society.<\\/p><h2>6. Testimonials<\\/h2><p>Client testimonials published on this website reflect the individual experiences of the clients who provided them. Testimonials are not necessarily representative of the experience of every client. Previous client experiences or investment outcomes do not guarantee similar results for others.<\\/p><h2>7. Third-Party Links<\\/h2><p>This website may contain links to third-party websites for your convenience, including property developers, builders, housing societies, and other real estate service providers. We do not endorse and are not responsible for the content, accuracy, availability, or privacy practices of any third-party website. Users should review the relevant terms and policies before relying on information provided by third parties.<\\/p><h2>8. Accuracy of Information<\\/h2><p>We take reasonable care to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date. However, property prices, availability, project details, payment plans, possession dates, legal requirements, and market conditions may change without notice. We make no warranty regarding the completeness or accuracy of the information provided and accept no liability for errors or omissions to the extent permitted by applicable law.<\\/p><p>Users are encouraged to verify all important information independently before making a property purchase, sale, or investment decision.<\\/p><p>See also our Terms & Conditions for further information regarding the use of this website and limitations of liability.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-22 07:14:41', '2026-10-28 02:05:37'),
(469, 64, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"lahore\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in lahore\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-27 06:14:02', '2026-10-27 06:14:02'),
(470, 64, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"lahore Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">lahore is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-27 06:14:02', '2026-10-28 02:01:04'),
